    "minimum": "<strong>最低配備:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位元的處理器及作業系統<br></li><li><strong>作業系統 *:</strong> Windows 7x64 / Windows 8.1x64 / Windows 10x64<br></li><li><strong>處理器:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.5 Ghz or AMD Phenom II 2.6 Ghz or greater<br></li><li><strong>記憶體:</strong> 4 GB 記憶體<br></li><li><strong>顯示卡:</strong> 1 GB &amp; AMD 5570 or nVidia 450 or Intel Integrated Graphics 530<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> 版本：11<br></li><li><strong>儲存空間:</strong> 17 GB 可用空間<br></li><li><strong>音效卡:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Device<br></li><li><strong>備註:</strong> Initial installation requires one-time Internet connection for Steam authentication; software installations required (included with the game) include Steam Client, Microsoft Visual C++ 2012 and 2015 Runtime Libraries, and Microsoft DirectX. Internet connection and acceptance of Steam™ Subscriber Agreement required for activation. See  for details.</li></ul>",
    "recommended": "<strong>建議配備:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>需要 64 位元的處理器及作業系統<br></li><li><strong>作業系統 *:</strong> Windows 7x64 / Windows 8.1x64 / Windows 10x64<br></li><li><strong>處理器:</strong> Fourth Generation Intel Core i5 2.5 Ghz or AMD FX8350 4.0 Ghz or greater<br></li><li><strong>記憶體:</strong> 8 GB 記憶體<br></li><li><strong>顯示卡:</strong> 2GB &amp; AMD 7970 or nVidia 770 or greater<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> 版本：11<br></li><li><strong>儲存空間:</strong> 23 GB 可用空間<br></li><li><strong>音效卡:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Device</li></ul>"
   },
